          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Gameplay is similar to the many other baseball released for the NES. The camera angle when batting or pitching is from behind the pitcher. The pitcher can pitch the ball high and low, as well as curve it. Tecmo Baseball includes digitized voices for the umpire.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La jugabilidad es similar a la de muchos otros juegos de béisbol lanzados para NES. El ángulo de cámara al batear o lanzar es desde detrás del pitcher. El pitcher puede lanzar la pelota alta o baja, además de darle efecto. Tecmo Baseball incluye voces digitalizadas para el árbitro.",
